#: ../../tools/fda_gsrs_tools.rst:36 87aa80ab85e540c7a97ab0d0e06a9771
msgid ""
"``unii`` (string) (required) FDA UNII code for the chemical substance. "
"Examples: 'R16CO5Y76E' (aspirin), '9100L32L2N' (ibuprofen), '4T6H12BN9U' "
"(metformin), 'IY9XDZ35W2' (cisplatin)."
msgstr ""

