#: ../../tools/fda_gsrs_tools.rst:61 d439e12ebd154e74b8db953073abbf7d
msgid "**Name**: ``FDAGSRS_get_substance``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/fda_gsrs_tools.rst:63 fb053e77d0894affbb9e0701c7284b19
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get full FDA substance record by UNII (Unique Ingredient"
" Identifier) code. Returns complete substance data including all names, "
"cross-references (DrugBank, WHO-ATC, CAS, EC number, CFR), structure, and"
" approval status. No API key required. UNII is the official FDA "
"identifier for all regulated substances. Example: UNII 'R16CO5Y76E' = "
"aspirin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/fda_gsrs_tools.rst:67 bd3bd4351ab64be097d1ff680ef11b04
msgid ""
"``unii`` (string) (required) FDA UNII (Unique Ingredient Identifier) "
"code. 10-character alphanumeric string. Examples: 'R16CO5Y76E' (aspirin),"
" '9100L32L2N' (ibuprofen), '4T6H12BN9U' (metformin), '57GNO57U7G' "
"(semaglutide)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/fda_gsrs_tools.rst:84 129ea29957f644ea8b02feffbfdd0274
msgid "**FDAGSRS_search_substances** (Type: FDAGSRSTool)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/fda_gsrs_tools.rst:86 fb4ed7c5bc1146bb9646fcbd0a04b8af
msgid ""
"Search FDA GSRS (Global Substance Registration System) for substances by "
"name, UNII code, InChIKe..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/fda_gsrs_tools.rst 7787bbf129724efc873715572d51d5b6
msgid "FDAGSRS_search_substances tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/fda_gsrs_tools.rst:92 4369e72921044245ad171552dab3a9e6
msgid "**Name**: ``FDAGSRS_search_substances``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/fda_gsrs_tools.rst:94 0713b8e89dae46d39e2620bea66af1b4
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search FDA GSRS (Global Substance Registration System) "
"for substances by name, UNII code, InChIKey, or formula. Returns official"
" FDA substance records with UNII identifiers, substance class, structure,"
" and cross-references (DrugBank, WHO-ATC, CAS, EC/EINECS, CFR). No API "
"key required. Example: 'aspirin' -> UNII R16CO5Y76E, chemical, approved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/fda_gsrs_tools.rst:98 457680fb74ce41fca936033c63edee07
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query: drug/chemical name, UNII "
"code, InChIKey, or molecular formula. Examples: 'aspirin', 'semaglutide',"
" 'R16CO5Y76E', 'C9H8O4', 'BSYNRYMUTXBXSQ-UHFFFAOYSA-N'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/fda_gsrs_tools.rst:101 6a3e3ce6dc964eeab3067330e703447f
msgid ""
"``substance_class`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by substance class. "
"Options: 'chemical', 'protein', 'mixture', 'polymer', 'nucleicAcid', "
"'structurallyDiverse', 'specifiedSubstanceG1'. Default: no filter (all "
"classes)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/fda_gsrs_tools.rst:104 b51f90f7beb44a1db10816a6fe707f0e
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer, null) (optional) Maximum number of results to return "
"(1-50, default 10)."
msgstr ""

